Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 00:54:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(hfdib): static first-order HFDIB rectangular-solid
 fvSource

DAFvSourceHFDIBStaticRect: passive geometry (lambda/masks/surface
points/normals/IDW stencils) + active residual path
(f_ib = chi * (M_h(U_ib) + grad p)) for a single stationary axis-aligned
rectangle, registered type 'hfdibStaticRect'. Header guards
addToRunTimeSelectionTable.H as required by this DAFoam/OpenFOAM build.
